{"data":{"id":"xVSoMo_Vthk","slug":"rich-boy","title":"Rich Boy","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"S7XAeg8FUCQ","slug":"throw-some-ds-vestige-remix","title":"Throw Some D's (VESTIGE Remix)"},{"id":"kLRmZg0Ht7k","slug":"throw-some-d-remix-instrumental","title":"throw some d remix instrumental"},{"id":"v821DB_1Cl0","slug":"throw-some-ds-gravez-remix-instrumental","title":"Throw Some D’s (Gravez Remix) (Instrumental)"},{"id":"mpqmjXkP9gc","slug":"throw-some-ds-gravez-vip","title":"Throw Some D's (Gravez VIP)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"sF6lfcdkjq8","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Rich Boy - Throw Some D's (VESTIGE Remix)","track":{"id":"S7XAeg8FUCQ","path":"/artists/rich-boy/tracks/throw-some-d-s-vestige-remix/","slug":"throw-some-ds-vestige-remix","title":"Throw Some D's (VESTIGE Remix)","artist":{"slug":"rich-boy","title":"Rich Boy"},"artwork":"images/artists/rich-boy/tracks/throw-some-d-s-vestige-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"U3ckiXHBqgw","slug":"147","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-147-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #147 w/ DJ Nobody","artwork":"/images/episodes/147.jpg","content":"We have Low End Theory's very own DJ Nobody in the studio with us. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe hope you're ready for not just another great session of musical selections but also a great 25+ minute discussion between DJ Nobody and Joe Kay. \nJoe kicked things off for a little over an hour & 33 minutes with new and forgotten gems. \n\nDo your research! Nobody made his 1st appearance on the show that was well overdue and went into a heavy/experimental beat journey ranging a variety of BPM's. \nWe discussed a bit of his background and really got into the history of Low End Theory and the progression of where it is today. \nNobody discussed crucial experiences that you would want to know so listen closely. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"LevjgYP5JIk","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Rich Boy - Throw Some D's (Vestige Remix)","track":{"id":"S7XAeg8FUCQ","path":"/artists/rich-boy/tracks/throw-some-d-s-vestige-remix/","slug":"throw-some-ds-vestige-remix","title":"Throw Some D's (VESTIGE Remix)","artist":{"slug":"rich-boy","title":"Rich Boy"},"artwork":"images/artists/rich-boy/tracks/throw-some-d-s-vestige-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9uuATI0cyb4","slug":"149","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-149-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #149 w/ House Shoes","artwork":"/images/episodes/149.jpg","content":"\nThe pioneer/legendary House Shoes kicks off exclusives from label Street Corner Music.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis man's musical selections, experiences/knowledge, and blunt personality is one that you can't deny. \n\nWe respect House Shoes! It was nice to finally have him come by and drop two different sets (that's right two!). \n\nHe kicked it off with exclusives from his new label Street Corner Music and then ended with some nice soulful joints. \n\nJoe Kay's discussion with Shoes also touched on many great subjects that many of you wanted to know. Enjoy.\n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10822,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":5}},{"id":"NFZ4nL8mVC4","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Rich Boy - Throw Some D's (Gravez VIP)","track":{"id":"mpqmjXkP9gc","path":"/artists/rich-boy/tracks/throw-some-d-s-gravez-vip/","slug":"throw-some-ds-gravez-vip","title":"Throw Some D's (Gravez VIP)","artist":{"slug":"rich-boy","title":"Rich Boy"},"artwork":"images/artists/rich-boy/tracks/throw-some-d-s-